{
  "runs": [
    [
      {
        "paceMs": 30,
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "I will set up two shots for this ring, Hero and Top, on studio white, render them, look at each take, and re-render what falls short."
          },
          {
            "type": "tool_use",
            "name": "scenes_list",
            "input": {
              "pieceId": "{{pieceId}}"
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "No saved shots yet, so I will save the two."
          },
          {
            "type": "tool_use",
            "name": "scenes_create",
            "input": {
              "pieceId": "{{pieceId}}",
              "title": "Hero",
              "scene": {
                "look": "catalog-white",
                "camera": {
                  "preset": "hero",
                  "focalLength": 90
                },
                "output": {
                  "width": 640,
                  "height": 640,
                  "quality": "preview"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "tool_use",
            "name": "scenes_create",
            "input": {
              "pieceId": "{{pieceId}}",
              "title": "Top",
              "scene": {
                "look": "catalog-white",
                "camera": {
                  "preset": "top",
                  "focalLength": 90
                },
                "output": {
                  "width": 640,
                  "height": 640,
                  "quality": "preview"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Both shots are saved. Rendering them now; each takes under a minute of this computer's time."
          },
          {
            "type": "tool_use",
            "name": "renders_create",
            "input": {
              "pieceId": "{{pieceId}}",
              "sceneId": "{{scene1}}",
              "title": "Hero"
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "tool_use",
            "name": "renders_create",
            "input": {
              "pieceId": "{{pieceId}}",
              "sceneId": "{{scene2}}",
              "title": "Top"
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "paceMs": 25,
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "thinking",
            "thinking": "Hero: sharp claws, the stone has contrast, framing fills the frame. Top: the table reads, but the band falls into shadow on the left; a stronger key would separate the shank from the white."
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The **Hero** take works: the claws are crisp and the centre stone has contrast against the white. The **Top** take is a little flat: the shank on the left falls into grey and does not separate from the backdrop. I will raise the key by 30% and render the Top shot again."
          },
          {
            "type": "tool_use",
            "name": "scenes_update",
            "input": {
              "id": "{{scene2}}",
              "patch": {
                "environment": {
                  "intensity": 1.3
                }
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "tool_use",
            "name": "renders_create",
            "input": {
              "pieceId": "{{pieceId}}",
              "sceneId": "{{scene2}}",
              "title": "Top",
              "retryOf": "{{take2}}",
              "note": "brighter key"
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "paceMs": 25,
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The brighter key fixed the Top: the shank now reads against the white without blowing the table.\n\n- **Hero**: first take kept.\n- **Top**: re-rendered once with a 30% brighter key.\n\nBoth are preview takes (640 px) from Blender. The set is ready for your review: swap a take, star one, or set the cover."
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "paceMs": 25,
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "One Hero take in each metal, as a pair you can compare."
          },
          {
            "type": "tool_use",
            "name": "renders_create",
            "input": {
              "pieceId": "{{pieceId}}",
              "title": "Hero",
              "groupId": "metals-1",
              "variantLabel": "18k rose gold",
              "scene": {
                "look": "catalog-white",
                "camera": {
                  "preset": "hero",
                  "focalLength": 90
                },
                "output": {
                  "width": 640,
                  "height": 640,
                  "quality": "preview"
                },
                "overrides": {
                  "*": {
                    "material": "au18k-rose"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "tool_use",
            "name": "renders_create",
            "input": {
              "pieceId": "{{pieceId}}",
              "title": "Hero",
              "groupId": "metals-1",
              "variantLabel": "Platinum",
              "scene": {
                "look": "catalog-white",
                "camera": {
                  "preset": "hero",
                  "focalLength": 90
                },
                "output": {
                  "width": 640,
                  "height": 640,
                  "quality": "preview"
                },
                "overrides": {
                  "*": {
                    "material": "pt950"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "paceMs": 25,
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Both metals are in. The rose gold warms the white backdrop and makes the diamond look whiter by contrast; the platinum reads cooler and closer to the stone. They are grouped as one variant set in the Render tab."
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  ]
}
